  "chain": "solenoid air valve contamination [cause B, vendor overhaul practices] -> delayed air venting from solenoid -> MSIV 29AOV-86C/86D slow closure (10.69s / 24.97s) -> two independent MSIV channels inoperable [inboard MSIVs remained operable]",
